# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Corpus data policy (Stage 1)
#
# COMMITTED (shared with collaborators):
#   corpus/metadata/          manifests, manifest CSV, audit JSON
#   corpus/raw/drafts/          Internet-Draft revision plaintext/XML
#   corpus/raw/rfcs/*.txt     RFC plaintext
#   corpus/raw/errata/
#
# IGNORED (re-fetchable local caches — not needed on other machines):
#   corpus/raw/rfcs/.rfcindex-cache/
#   ietf-dt-cache.sqlite        Datatracker HTTP cache (see *.sqlite below)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
corpus/raw/rfcs/.rfcindex-cache/

# Pilot-local experiment mirrors (not the canonical corpus tree)
experiments/pilot/data/raw/
experiments/pilot/data/processed/

